<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply higher in quiet trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 73.98 to 5733.84.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 3.61 to 356.28.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.40.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1536 to 851.</p>
<p>Volume was 310,886,460, compared with 348,682,480 Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
